    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "The polarized rhetoric surrounding the Crimean Annexation makes compromise amid past discourse impossible, which has led to a stagnation of dialogue and drawn out sanctions against Russia. The global econo-political divide that has formed along trade-lines, an unintended consequence of sanctioning, should be of concern to all parties, as a major power conflict could easily arise from a divided international system.",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
